Source: lion-session
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: LionOS Project <packaging@lionos.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, rustc, dbus, python3
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://lionos.org/

Package: lion-session
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, dbus
Description: LionOS user session manager
 Owns a logged-in desktop session end-to-end: environment setup,
 any-compositor supervision with crash recovery, XDG + TOML autostart
 with phases and per-app cgroup limits, the cooperative
 end-of-session protocol (query/veto/force), idle escalation into
 lock/logout, lock-before-sleep and lock-on-shutdown, logind
 inhibitors, and a versioned D-Bus surface (os.lionos.Session).
